    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  \ud83d\udc3e <strong>Relax &amp; Unwind</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe1 Settle in, make some \ud83c\udf75tea, and build a home for the cutest \ud83d\udc32 dragons you\u2019ve ever seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472390/extras/60789424c4ce0d2bd0f628a44e041521.poster.avif?t=1754768644\" width=600 height=199 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472390/extras/60789424c4ce0d2bd0f628a44e041521.webm?t=1754768644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfe1 Create and customize your Dragon Sanctuary!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3e\ud83e\udd55Grow crops to feed your dragons\u00a0\ud83c\udf45\ud83e\udd6c</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472390/extras/35223565f81cdd801b409fcd5bece291.poster.avif?t=1754768644\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472390/extras/35223565f81cdd801b409fcd5bece291.webp?t=1754768644\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=199 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc09 Make sure to pet your dragons to help keep them happy!\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udc32</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472390/extras/2043851911e1db4dd8679c794a693d45.poster.avif?t=1754768644\" width=600 height=199 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472390/extras/2043851911e1db4dd8679c794a693d45.webm?t=1754768644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't forget to give them a comfy place to sleep!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472390/extras/358f41bb0f8fa8d7b38bbf6f4fede804.poster.avif?t=1754768644\" width=600 height=199 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472390/extras/358f41bb0f8fa8d7b38bbf6f4fede804.webm?t=1754768644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  \ud83d\udc3e <strong>Relax &amp; Unwind</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe1 Settle in, make some \ud83c\udf75tea, and build a home for the cutest \ud83d\udc32 dragons you\u2019ve ever seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472390/extras/60789424c4ce0d2bd0f628a44e041521.poster.avif?t=1754768644\" width=600 height=199 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472390/extras/60789424c4ce0d2bd0f628a44e041521.webm?t=1754768644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfe1 Create and customize your Dragon Sanctuary!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3e\ud83e\udd55Grow crops to feed your dragons\u00a0\ud83c\udf45\ud83e\udd6c</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472390/extras/35223565f81cdd801b409fcd5bece291.poster.avif?t=1754768644\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472390/extras/35223565f81cdd801b409fcd5bece291.webp?t=1754768644\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=199 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc09 Make sure to pet your dragons to help keep them happy!\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udc32</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472390/extras/2043851911e1db4dd8679c794a693d45.poster.avif?t=1754768644\" width=600 height=199 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472390/extras/2043851911e1db4dd8679c794a693d45.webm?t=1754768644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't forget to give them a comfy place to sleep!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472390/extras/358f41bb0f8fa8d7b38bbf6f4fede804.poster.avif?t=1754768644\" width=600 height=199 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472390/extras/358f41bb0f8fa8d7b38bbf6f4fede804.webm?t=1754768644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
